                  \\psi'(b_2)^{-1}(\lambda(b_1))\lambda(b_2)
          %p
            In order to obtain a relation between
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
