          %h2#examples Examples
          %p
            By the above classification theorems, all the examples at
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+cohomology"} group cohomology
            equivalently induce examples for group extensions. And indeed by definition every
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/short+exact+sequence"} short exact sequence
            defines an extension.
          %p But examples of fundamental importance include for instance
          %ul
            %li
