                  %a{:href => "https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-1-4684-9327-6"} doi:10.1007/978-1-4684-9327-6
          %p Lecture and course notes, etc.:
          %ul
            %li#Conrad
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Brian+Conrad"}> Brian Conrad
                \:
                %em Group cohomology and group extensions
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://math.stanford.edu/~conrad/210BPage/handouts/gpext.pdf"}> pdf
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Conrad-GroupCohomologyExtensions.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li#Ho
              %p
                Raphael Ho:
                %em
                  Classification of group extensions in
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi H
                          %mn 2
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} H^2
                (2011) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://math.uchicago.edu/~may/VIGRE/VIGRE2011/REUPapers/Ho.pdf"}> pdf
                ,
                = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Ho-GroupExtensions.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Terry+Tao"}> Terry Tao
                ,
                %em Some notes on group extensions
                \&amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "http://terrytao.wordpress.com/2010/01/23/some-notes-on-group-extensions/"}> blog
                \&amp;rbrack;
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Patrick+Morandi"}> Patrick Morandi
                ,
                %em
                  Group extensions and
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi H
                          %mn 3
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} H^3
                (
                %a{:href => "http://sierra.nmsu.edu/morandi/notes/GroupExtensions.pdf"}> pdf
                )
              %p
                %em Nobabelian cohomology
                (
                %a{:href => "http://sierra.nmsu.edu/morandi/notes/nonabeliancohomology.pdf"}> pdf
                )
            %li
              %p
                Raphael Ho,
                %em
                  Classifications of group extensions and
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi H
                          %mn 2
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} H^2
                (
                %a{:href => "http://www.math.uchicago.edu/~may/VIGRE/VIGRE2011/REUPapers/Ho.pdf"}> pdf
                )
          %p See also:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/R.+Brown"}> R. Brown
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/T.+Porter"} T. Porter
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On the Schreier theory of non-abelian extensions: generalisations and computations
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Manuel+Bullejos"}> Manuel Bullejos
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Antonio+M.+Cegarra"} Antonio M. Cegarra
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Antonio+M.+Cegarra"}> Antonio M. Cegarra
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Antonio+R.+Garz%C3%B3n"} Antonio R. Garzón
          %p A theory for central 2-group extensions is here:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Antonio+R.+Garz%C3%B3n"} Antonio R. Garzón
              and E.M. Vitale, On the second cohomology categorical group and a Hochschild-Serre 2-exact sequence, Theory and Applications of Categories, Vol. 30 (2015), 933-984. (
              %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/30/27/30-27.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p
            See also references to Dedecker listed
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/zoranskoda/show/Paul+Dedecker"} here
          %h3#applications Applications
          %p
            A bit of discussion of some occurences of central extensions of groups in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/physics"} physics
            is in
          %ul
            %li
              G. Tuynman and W. Wiegerinck,
              %em Central extensions of physics
              (
              %a{:href => "http://math.univ-lille1.fr/~gmt/PaperFolder/CentralExtensions.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p (In fact there are many more than mentioned in that introduction.)
          %p
            Extensions of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supergroups"} supergroups
            are discussed in
          %ul
            %li#Drupieski14
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Christopher+Drupieski"}> Christopher Drupieski
              ,
              %em Strict polynomial superfunctors and universal extension classes for algebraic supergroups
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1408.5764"}> arXiv:1408.5764
              )
        .revisedby
